The most powerful physics simulation addon for Blender to give you the tools to create studio quality physics simulation results! Developed by [a former simulation software developer from Walt Disney Animation Studio](contact/about.md), **HiPhyEngine** is fast, intersection-free, all-in-one multi-physics simulation engine designed for full artistic control without compromising performance. It has many exclusive features that are not available in any other commercial physics simulators.

